Description: fail a completed conclusion that gh files under its pending bucket
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: no

gh's `bucket` field is a convenience grouping and it files states it does not
name alongside the in-flight ones, so a check that had already finished with a
conclusion such as STALE, STARTUP_FAILURE or CANCELLED arrived as
bucket "pending". parseFastCheck trusted the bucket alone and reported that check
as still running: the watcher waited on it for the rest of the run and never
reported a failure. Only states that are genuinely in flight are pending now;
anything else in that bucket has finished and did not pass.

